<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Academic on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/academic/</link><description>Recent content in Academic on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/academic/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>academic-research-skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/imbad0202-academic-research-skills/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/imbad0202-academic-research-skills/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This repository bundles the following skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Research&lt;/strong&gt;: A 13-agent research skill with modes including full, quick, review, and fact-check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Paper&lt;/strong&gt;: A 12-agent paper-writing skill with modes including plan, outline-only, and revision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Paper Reviewer&lt;/strong&gt;: A 7-agent multi-perspective review skill with full and re-review modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Academic Pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;: A 10-stage orchestrator skill managing the full workflow with integrity verification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>nature-skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/yuan1z0825-nature-skills/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/yuan1z0825-nature-skills/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This repository bundles the following skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-reader&lt;/strong&gt;: Generates a bilingual Chinese-English Markdown reader of a paper with figure-text alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-polishing&lt;/strong&gt;: Revises academic text into Nature-style English with consistent terminology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-paper2ppt&lt;/strong&gt;: Converts a research paper into a presentation deck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-reviewer&lt;/strong&gt;: Simulates a blinded, three-reviewer peer review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-response&lt;/strong&gt;: Generates a point-by-point rebuttal to reviewer comments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-figure&lt;/strong&gt;: Produces publication-grade, multi-panel scientific figures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;nature-academic-search&lt;/strong&gt;: Performs multi-source literature search with citation verification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Consensus</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/consensus/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/consensus/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Dimensions</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/dimensions-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/dimensions-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Dovetail</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/dovetail-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/dovetail-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Elicit</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/elicit-research/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/elicit-research/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Elicit</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/elicit/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/elicit/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Explainpaper</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/explainpaper/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/explainpaper/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Inciteful</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/inciteful/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/inciteful/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Lens.org</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/lens-org/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/lens-org/</guid><description/></item><item><title>NotebookLM Plus</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/notebook-lm-plus/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/notebook-lm-plus/</guid><description/></item><item><title>OpenRead</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/openread/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https: